    "All Seeing Hammer": "All Seeing Hammer",
    "Forbidden Flowers Extract-lore": "Feared not for its danger, but for what it could awaken. With a power deemed too disruptive to remain, this flower clears what festers beneath the surface.",
    "All Seeing Axe-lore": "This axe watches the fear around it — in both its foes and its bearer.",
    "Cthulhu Axe-lore": "In everything that crawls across the lands lies dormant an ancient mind.",
    "Dead Vulture-lore": "The vultures of Penumbra chase death, even after their own life fades.",
    "Golden Needle Sword-lore": "True treasure does not lie in material wealth, but in the light of preserved history.",
    "Ice Axe-lore": "Frozen in time, its blade cuts not flesh, but seconds.",
    "Penumbra Suit-lore": "The physical and astral legacy of the ancient Order of Penumbra.",
    "Royal War Staff-lore": "It is not magic that consumes its enemies, but the nostalgia of golden ages that will never return.",
    "Seabane-lore": "Whispers of a deep sea echo from this staff — carried from an ocean beneath an unknown moon.",
    "Throat Cutter-lore": "From the eternal flames of the Dead Volcano, a living blade was forged.",
    "Wooden Hawaiian-lore": "Unerring and relentless, it strikes even that which dwells beyond other planes.",
    "Nightshade-lore": "A restless void comes to inhabit its bearer, filling spaces that should not exist.",
    "Tunic of Ominous Comrades-lore": "The dice have been cast... And when chance speaks louder, even entities fall silent.",
    "The Ancient Codices-lore": "Abysses beyond comprehension, suspended among stars, distort the sanity of their bearers.",
    "Blood Swiftblade-lore": "Forged in the oath of those who fought to the last drop.",
    "Azatoth-lore": "Conceived in the silence before the stars, its reach erases matter and unravels memory.",
    "Goldsteel Sword-lore": "The gold of this blade is to greed what its beauty is to death.",
    "Necromorphicon-lore": "There are no inscriptions. Only scars through which visions of the reader's fate bleed.",
    "Vindictive Piercer-lore": "In a breath, it marks. In silence, it condemns.",
    "Frost-heart Sword-lore": "Ripper of destinies. Where blood crystallizes before meeting the ground.",
    "Malicious Quickblade-lore": "Divide to conquer. And slice to advance!",
    "All Seeing Cleaver-lore": "The sentence that learned to hunt fear. Never looking away.",
    "Wealthy Smasher Hammer-lore": "All that is most precious may one day be found in the most unsanitary depths.",
